      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The system has a web-based intergraded scoring system called the OMP. The
    OMP gives access to the results of every training and allows you to keep track
    of the ranking. The ranking shows you the list of the top 5 shooters in all your
    recent trainees. Note, scoring does not always require you to keep your computer
    connected to the internet. You can run all your trainings offline, and connect
    once to the internet for the software to automatically upload the results to
    the OMP. Alternatively, you can keep your computer connected to the internet,
    and allow the software to automatically or manually save after every complete
